        "comparison_level.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies the territory level that will be used for the comparison or realignment report.</p><ul><li><span title=\"ALL_LEVELS\">All Levels</span>—All territory levels will be used for the comparison or realignment report.</li></ul></xdoc>",
